      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "VietnameseText": "H\u1ECD t\u00ECm th\u1EA5y b\u1ED1n chi\u1EBFc m\u0169, hai b\u00ECnh n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\u00E0 m\u1ED9t quy\u1EC3n v\u1EDF.",
