      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "VietnameseText": "Nh\u1EEFng m\u00F3n c\u00F2n l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\u1EBFp g\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1ECDc sinh d\u1EC5 xem.",
